      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.46. Net income: ₹728.0m (up ₹728.0m from 3Q 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 3.6%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 16%. Revenue is forecast to grow 27% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India.",
