      "body": "Rubicon Research Limited announced the appointment of Ms. Avani Harish Shah as Senior Management Personnel of the Company with effect from January 09, 2026. Avani is a legal professional with 20+ years of corporate legal experience in information technology and services industry. Her previous employment was with LTIMindtree Limited as a Senior Legal Director. Her prior assignments include Associate Director at Ramco Systems Limited, Assistant General Counsel at Capgemini Technologies SE (Paris & India) and managerial positions at Essar Group and Oracle Financial Services Software. She began her legal career as an Associate at Gordhandas and Fozdar (Advocates and Solicitors). Avani holds a master's degree in law (Intellectual Property Rights) and a bachelor's degree in law from Government L",
